        </summary>
        <div class="body">
          <ul>
          <li>Hands-on AI coach for pharmacy-services finance teams: role-based AI curriculum, workshops, hackathons and a champion network.</li>
          <li>Build prompt libraries and plain-language guides, then measure adoption.</li>
          <li>The posting says outright it is not an engineering, governance or product role. Up to 10 percent travel.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="why"><b>Strong:</b> every stated minimum. Five years relevant work, three designing enablement or change programs and two driving adoption without authority are the Innovation Center and Program Director years plus the 45-faculty online transition. The one-year AI enablement bar is the ARC domain co-chair work. A named required skill is explaining Copilot versus Claude Desktop versus Claude Cowork, which you do daily.</p>
          <p class="why"><b>Light:</b> corporate finance audience, Copilot is thinner than Claude for you, and Copilot Studio certification is strongly preferred. The bottom of the band dips under your $80,000 floor, so ask where Denver lands.</p>
          <div class="foot"><span class="tool">Lead with: the ARC AI domain co-chair role</span><a class="apply" href="https://cvshealth.wd1.myworkdayjobs.com/CVS_Health_Careers/job/IL---Chicago/Manager--AI-User-Enablement_R1044982" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Apply &rarr;</a></div>
        </div>
      </details>

