          <p class="why"><b>Light:</b> one to two years of business analysis and process mapping is only partly covered, by the LMS RFP and ITIL service agreements. It expects fluency with APIs and data architecture concepts. Preferred PMP, CSPO or Prosci are not held. Research and finance admin, not teaching.</p>
