          <div class="foot"><span class="tool">Lead with: the ARC service crosswalk</span><a class="apply" href="https://www.governmentjobs.com/careers/colorado/jobs/5467472" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Apply &rarr;</a></div>
        </div>
      </details>

      <details class="card local">
        <summary class="cardtop">
          <span class="srow"><span class="tag rank">#5</span><span class="stars" aria-label="Four out of five stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9734;</span><span class="tag tag-new">New 27 Sept</span></span>
