          <p class="why"><b>Strong:</b> bachelor&rsquo;s, five to eight years in L&amp;D or instructional design, facilitation, and content authoring and learning-tech tools are all cleared by the Program Director years, the faculty-development course you built and the QM and OSCQR review work.</p>
